<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<title>utxoproof descriptor check</title>
<style>
  body { font-family: sans-serif; max-width: 900px; margin: 2em auto; padding: 0 1em; color: #222; }
  table { border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; margin: 1em 0; }
  th, td { border: 1px solid #999; padding: 0.4em 0.6em; text-align: left; }
  th { background: #eee; }
  code { word-break: break-all; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<h1>utxoproof descriptor check</h1>
<p>Addresses below are derived live by <code>utxoproof.descriptors</code> from the
BIP84 spec-vector account xpub (<code>{{ xpub }}</code>, fingerprint
<code>{{ fingerprint }}</code>). They must match the BIP84 vectors exactly.</p>

<h2>Descriptors (Bitcoin Core import)</h2>
<table>
  <tr><th>Chain</th><th>Descriptor</th></tr>
  <tr><td>external</td><td><code>{{ external }}</code></td></tr>
  <tr><td>change</td><td><code>{{ change }}</code></td></tr>
</table>

<h2>First addresses (mainnet)</h2>
<table>
  <tr><th>Path</th><th>Address</th></tr>
  {% for row in addresses %}
  <tr><td>{{ row.path }}</td><td><code>{{ row.address }}</code></td></tr>
  {% endfor %}
</table>
</body>
</html>
